    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Nan Gristle</strong> signals the Lower market's overhead bone trolleys from a loft above the rails: a broad, loud, cheerful old half-orc with a brass speaking-trumpet, signal flags in her apron and a bell on a post by her chair.</p><p><strong>GM notes (Part 7).</strong> Ally, not in the Thaw. Lends the signal bell for T6; once a night she can hold the tenth-hour trolley so Tallis is late (Scene 5). Source of Clue G (Tallis rides the tenth-hour trolley).</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
