    {
      "_id": "5a71af086d1399ee",
      "name": "Lore Reference: Trolley Times and Tallis's Rounds",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Trolley Times and Tallis's Rounds</h2><p>[COMMON/ASK] She knows every trolley time, every regular rider, Tallis's rounds, and which corridors carry sound.</p><ul><li>The <strong>last trolley of the night</strong> is the one that sets \"the usual time\" (she doesn't know that matters).</li><li>Tallis rides the <strong>tenth-hour trolley</strong> every night now and times it (Clue G: the pressure).</li><li>She can hold the tenth-hour a few minutes (her Signal Bell and Trumpet, once a night): Tallis is late to the cold door.</li><li>The signal bell is lendable for T6 (\"Bring it back with its tongue in\").</li></ul><p><strong>She does not know:</strong> anything about the Thaw, Cladis or the cold door.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
