    {
      "_id": "ba869aeeea31c496",
      "name": "GM Reference: Lil' Apostrophe at the Signal Loft",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>Lil' Apostrophe at the Signal Loft</h2><p>Nan: <em>\"THE DUCK BOY.\"</em> Lil: <em>\"Hi! Was I supposed to be here?\"</em> Nan: <em>\"You're always supposed to be here.\"</em></p><p>The duck afternoon: the ducks rode her trolleys for a whole afternoon, and she thought it was the best day in years. If Lil writes BELL on the bell (T6), roll Part 3; if the result is loud, the test still works, and Tallis hears it from two corridors away.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
